{
  "format": 4,
  "kind": "replay",
  "name": "Memberships",
  "description": "A membership is a logged record keyed by (room_id, user.user_id); the greatest log_id wins, from any source or arrival order. A room's complete members list (room_list with members, room_update joined) starts its member list as of the room's latest_log_id in that frame: memberships at or below it are already in it, greater ones apply on top, whichever arrives first. A compacted history record folds several users' memberships under the greatest folded log_id and keeps leaves. A membership's user is the recorded object and projects as given.",
  "references": [
    "PROTOCOL.md#2-identifiers",
    "PROTOCOL.md#421-listing",
    "PROTOCOL.md#422-membership",
    "PROTOCOL.md#43-history"
  ],
